      "id": "sol.ahsme-1980-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The number must be less than \\(\\frac{100}{7}=14+\\frac{2}{7}.\\) The largest whole number below this value is \\(14.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C.",
